<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

<main class="container" style="padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 5rem;">
  <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
        Please read these terms carefully before accessing or using the eKart platform.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="padding: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-main);">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        1. User Account Registration
      </h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        When creating an eKart account, you agree to provide truthful, accurate, and current information. You are solely responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials.
      </p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        2. Pricing and Product Information
      </h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        Prices, product descriptions, and stock quantities listed on eKart are verified against our database at the exact moment an order is confirmed. In the event of pricing discrepancies or inadvertent stock exhaustion, eKart reserves the right to cancel or refund the order promptly.
      </p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        3. Payment and Order Fulfillment
      </h3>
      <p>
        Orders are processed upon verification of inventory and payment confirmation. For simulated local testing mode, transactions are mock-authorized to demonstrate application workflows.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
